messages.content:
{
  "message": "I can help. Because you’re abroad, the most common causes are: (1) roaming not enabled on your line or phone, (2) mobile data or Data Saver/VPN settings on the device, (3) network mode set to older tech, or (4) you’ve hit your plan’s data limit. Here’s the plan: first I’ll verify your account/line (roaming eligibility and data usage). In parallel, please run a few quick checks on your phone so we can pinpoint the cause. Once we have both sets of info, I’ll either enable roaming on your line, address any data limit issues (refuel or plan change if you want), or guide you to the exact device setting to fix. My goal is to get you to Excellent speed if the local network and your device support it.",
  "what_i_need_from_you_to_identify_account": "For technical support I must locate your account. Please provide ONE of the following: (a) the phone number of the affected line, or (b) your customer ID, or (c) your full name and date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD).",
  "additional_questions": [
    "Are you currently in France right now? If yes, which city/area?",
    "Roughly when did the problem start?",
    "Do you see 5G/4G/LTE/3G in the status bar, or does it show No Service/E only/2G?",
    "Are you using a VPN?",
    "Which phone model are you using?"
  ],
  "please_run_these_device_checks_and_share_the_results": [
    {
      "action": "check_network_status",
      "why": "Confirms if Mobile Data is ON and whether Data Roaming is ON on the device, plus current signal strength and network type."
    },
    {
      "action": "check_network_mode_preference",
      "why": "We want this on 4g_5g_preferred for best speeds."
    },
    {
      "action": "check_data_restriction_status",
      "why": "Data Saver can slow or block background data."
    },
    {
      "action": "check_vpn_status",
      "why": "VPNs abroad can slow traffic or block apps."
    },
    {
      "action": "run_speed_test",
      "why": "Shows current speed category; we’re aiming for Excellent."
    },
    {
      "action": "check_apn_settings",
      "why": "Incorrect APN/MMSC can break or slow data/MMS."
    }
  ],
  "if_you_prefer_quick_fixes_now_before_results": [
    "If Mobile Data is OFF, turn it ON (toggle_data).",
    "If Data Roaming is OFF on the phone, turn it ON (toggle_roaming). This is often the key step while abroad.",
    "If network mode is on 2G/3G, set it to 4g_5g_preferred (set_network_mode_preference).",
    "If Data Saver is ON, turn it OFF (toggle_data_saver_mode).",
    "If a VPN is connected, disconnect it (disconnect_vpn).",
    "If APN looks wrong or blank, reset APN to default (reset_apn_settings) and then reboot the device (reboot_device)."
  ],
  "what_i_will_do_once_i_can_find_your_account": [
    "Verify your line’s roaming setting; if it’s not enabled, I will enable roaming at no cost so you can use data in France.",
    "Check current-cycle data usage vs. your plan limit. If you’ve hit the cap, I can refuel up to 2 GB immediately (charged at your plan’s per-GB rate) or help you change to a plan with more data.",
    "Confirm there’s no suspension or billing hold impacting data.",
    "If everything is fine on the account side, I’ll focus on device settings based on the diagnostics you share to reach Excellent speeds where the local network allows."
  ],
  "next_step": "Please share your account identifier (phone number, customer ID, or full name + DOB) and paste the outputs of the checks above. I’ll proceed right away."
}

