messages.content:
{
  "message": "I can help. Here’s my plan and why: I’ll (1) check your account/line for anything that could slow or block data (suspension, data cap, roaming settings), and (2) walk you through quick phone-side checks to restore excellent speeds. To get started, please provide one of the following to identify your account: • The phone number for the line with the issue (preferred), or • Your customer ID, or • Your full name AND date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD). While I get your account ready, a few quick questions to better target the fix: 1) Where are you right now (city/state/country)? Are you traveling outside your usual area? 2) When did the slow/no data start? Is it constant or only in certain places/times? 3) Do you have any VPN apps enabled? 4) Is anyone else on your account seeing the same issue? Next, please run these on your phone and share the exact results you see (this helps me decide the fastest fix): A) check_status_bar — tell me: • Airplane mode shown or not • Signal bars (None/📶¹/📶²/📶³/📶⁴) • Network type shown (5G/4G/LTE/3G/2G) • Data icon (Data Enabled/Disabled) B) check_network_status — confirm: • Signal strength (none/poor/fair/good/excellent) • Network type • Mobile data ON/OFF • Data roaming ON/OFF C) run_speed_test — report the download rating (unknown/very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent). If it says no connection, tell me. D) check_data_restriction_status — whether Data Saver is ON. E) check_vpn_status — whether a VPN is connected. F) check_network_mode_preference — what mode is set (e.g., 4g_5g_preferred, 4g_only, 3g, 2g). Why these steps: • If you’re out of data or the line is suspended, I’ll fix that from the account side. • If Data, VPN, or Data Saver are limiting speed, we’ll toggle them. • If the phone is locked to slower tech (e.g., 3G), we’ll switch to 4G/5G preferred for maximum speed. • If you’re roaming, I’ll enable roaming on your line if needed (no cost) and ensure phone-side roaming is ON. Send me your line’s phone number and the results above, and I’ll take the next actions right away."
}

