    "If APN settings look wrong on your device, I’ll guide you to reset_apn_settings and then reboot_device."
  ],
  "please_reply_with": [
    "Your phone number.",
    "Whether you’re traveling/roaming.",
    "The results from: check_status_bar, check_network_status, and run_speed_test."
  ]
}

