messages.content:
{
  "message": "Your phone is reporting the SIM as Missing. That’s why there’s no signal. Let’s reseat the physical SIM first—this fixes most “No SIM” issues.",
  "thought_process": "Since your line is Active on our side, a “SIM missing” status points to a local hardware/placement issue: the SIM may not be making good contact, is in the wrong orientation, or the tray/reader has debris. Reseating and cleaning the SIM/tray is the fastest, safest next step. If it still shows Missing afterward, we’ll isolate whether the SIM or the phone’s SIM reader is at fault by cross-testing.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": "Power off the phone",
      "why": "Prevents any damage and ensures a clean re-detect of the SIM on boot."
    },
    {
      "step": "Remove the SIM tray",
      "how_to": [
        "Remove any phone case.",
        "Use the SIM eject tool (or a small paperclip) to eject the tray.",
        "Note the SIM’s orientation (look for the corner notch)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Inspect and clean",
      "what_to_check": [
        "SIM: Ensure it’s not bent, cracked, or heavily scratched on the gold contacts.",
        "Tray/slot: Check for dust or debris."
      ],
      "cleaning": "Gently wipe the SIM’s gold contacts with a dry, lint-free cloth. Do not use liquids."
    },
    {
      "step": "Reinsert carefully",
      "how_to": [
        "Place the SIM in the tray in the correct orientation (match the notch).",
        "Ensure it sits flat and snug—no wobble.",
        "Fully seat the tray back into the phone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Power on and wait",
      "after": "Turn the phone back ON and wait up to 2 minutes. Then check the status bar and SIM status again.",
      "check": [
        "Settings > SIM/Cellular > SIM status should show Active (not Missing).",
        "Mobile Data should be ON.",
        "Preferred network type should be 4G/5G (which you already have)."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "if_still_missing_after_reseat": [
    "Test the SIM in another unlocked phone if available. Does it get detected there?",
    "Alternatively, try a known-good SIM in your phone. Does your phone detect that SIM?",
    "Results guide us: If your SIM works elsewhere, your phone’s SIM reader/tray may be the issue. If your SIM fails elsewhere too, the SIM is likely defective."
  ],
  "ask_for_update": "Please reseat the SIM now and tell me exactly what the phone reports afterward (SIM status and what you see in the status bar). If it still says Missing, let me know whether you can try the cross-test with another phone or another SIM. Based on your results, I’ll advise the next step.",
  "note": "If the SIM remains undetected after reseating and cross-testing, I can arrange the next steps for a replacement SIM or further device support."
}

