      "title": "Set Network Mode to 4G/5G Preferred",
      "how": "On Android: Settings > Mobile network (or Connections) > Mobile networks > Network mode/Preferred network type > choose 4G/5G (LTE/5G preferred). On Samsung: Settings > Connections > Mobile networks > Network mode > 5G/LTE/3G/2G (auto).",
      "why": "Ensures the phone connects to faster networks that support MMS."
    },
    {
      "title": "Refresh the radios",
      "how": "Toggle Airplane Mode ON for ~10–15 seconds, then OFF.",
      "why": "Forces a clean re-registration to the network after changing modes."
