  "optional_signal_tip": "If you still see only 1 bar after the above, try moving near a window or outdoors and re-test. Weak signal can also hinder MMS.",
  "questions": [
    "Which Android brand/model is it (e.g., Samsung Galaxy, Google Pixel)? I can tailor the exact menu names.",
