  "my_thought_process": "Your line is active and roaming is enabled on our side, so the blocker is on the phone: it’s not seeing the SIM/eSIM. We’ll first try a safe restart, then (if needed) reseat the SIM if there’s a tray, or toggle the eSIM line if there isn’t.",
