        "Open Settings.",
        "On iPhone: Settings > Cellular > tap your plan > toggle “Turn On This Line” OFF, wait 10 seconds, then ON.",
        "On Android: Settings > Network & Internet (or Connections) > SIMs/Mobile network > toggle your SIM/line OFF, wait 10 seconds, then ON.",
