      "title": "Optional diagnostics (only if still failing)",
      "do": [
        "Run: can_send_mms() and tell me the result.",
        "Run: check_data_restriction_status. If it shows Data Saver ON, run toggle_data_saver_mode to turn it OFF and retry MMS."
