      "step": "Verify APN/MMSC",
      "instructions": [
        "Run check_apn_settings and tell me if MMSC URL is present.",
        "If MMSC is missing/incorrect, reset_apn_settings to default.",
        "Then reboot_device to apply changes."
      ],
      "why": "A correct MMSC URL in APN is required for MMS. Changes need a reboot to take effect."
    },
    {
      "step": "Confirm messaging app permissions",
      "instructions": [
        "Run check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\").",
        "If Storage and SMS permissions are not granted, run:",
