  "thought_process": "Since Airplane Mode is OFF but you still see No Signal and Data Disabled, the phone isn’t registering on a network. The next critical checks are (1) SIM status (present/active vs. missing/locked) and (2) network mode preference (ensure 4G/5G is allowed). We’ll start with SIM status because a missing/locked SIM will prevent any signal.",
