      "why": "Ensures the phone is allowed to attach to modern partner networks while roaming.",
      "how_on_android": [
        "Settings > Network & Internet (or Connections).",
        "Mobile network (or SIMs) > Preferred network type / Network mode.",
        "Select 4G/5G preferred (or 5G/LTE/3G/2G auto)."
